 "notes": [
  "Starting cards as posted under 'Starting7': Court Of The Vile Gangster / I Shall Enjoy Watching You Die, All Wrapped Up, Power Of The Hutt, Jabba's Palace: Dungeon, Jabba's Palace: Audience Chamber, Tatooine: Great Pit Of Carkoon and Prepared Defenses; these count toward the total. Two Effects start, neither named as the starting Effect, so no starting Effect is set.",
  "The deck title repeated at the top of the card list was not a card and is dropped. The posted alternative '(or none of those effects and Pr. Def. , but use AMnecessary)(use that to get a bounty hunter / weappn and ship)' is a comment, not a card; Any Methods Necessary is already in the Interrupts.",
  "The published list totals 61 cards (Starting 7, Weapons 4, Effects 6, Characters 22, Interrupts 6, Vehicles 3, Creatures 3, Starships 5, Sites 5); kept as published.",
  "Posted 'Court/isewyd' dested Court Of The Vile Gangster / I Shall Enjoy Watching You Die; 'Darth Vader w/ Stick' Darth Vader With Lightsaber; 'AOrnament/WWookiee' Abyssin Ornament & Wounded Wookiee; 'OB/ It's worse' Ommni Box & It's Worse; 'Def. Fire/ Hutt Smooch' Defensive Fire & Hutt Smooch.",
  "Dark pages dested for the dual-printed cards: Jabba's Palace: Audience Chamber (Dark), Tatooine: Lars' Moisture Farm (Dark), Vibro-Ax (Dark), Skiff (Dark); 'T Docking Bay' dested Tatooine: Docking Bay 94 (Dark) and 'T Desert' Tatooine: Desert (Dark).",
  "The same deck (same title and description) was later published on Game Players Network on 5 December 2001 as [[ar2dee2 Revenge of the Hutt]]."
